{"4419460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Inken", "steam_appid": 4419460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inken is a multi-genre roguelike where you play a variety of games and gain persistent upgrades through puzzle solving and game mastery!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a wide variety of genres in bite sized games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of simple and complex puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play large, challenging roguelike games that use persistent upgrades from completed puzzles and micro games!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With, a Deck-Builder, a Top-Down Shooter, an Auto-Scroller, an Idle game, and a Farming Sim, you can enjoy a wide variety of games choose your favorites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419460/extras/7483b994d11fa15f9b8b9c80ea5ca0a9.avif?t=1787073434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419460/extras_big/7483b994d11fa15f9b8b9c80ea5ca0a9.webp?t=1787073434 width=1560 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inken Spire is a full deckbuilding monster-battler with over 40 cards and many synergies to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419460/extras/20022207c42de47d89f0d96318f01f0c.avif?t=1787073434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419460/extras_big/20022207c42de47d89f0d96318f01f0c.webp?t=1787073434 width=1560 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inken Temple is a fast paced dungeon crawler with a wide variety of foes to challenge and mysteries to solve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p clas